                        G. L. Jones (NE) and Messrs. Crowe and
                        Hewitt (L); authorized for transmission and signed for the Secretary by Mr.
                        Popper (UNP). Repeated for information to London, Paris, Cairo, and Tel
                    Aviv.</p>
            </note>
